A small, cross-platform World of Warcraft addon manager

Usage:
  knapsack [flags]
  knapsack [command]

Available Commands:
  completion  Generate the autocompletion script for the specified shell
  config      Manage profiles and config.toml
  help        Help about any command
  version     Print the knapsack version

Flags:
      --config string   use this config file instead of the default
  -h, --help            help for knapsack
  -v, --verbose         show the underlying cause of errors

Use "knapsack [command] --help" for more information about a command.
